<h2>Privacy Policy – SMS Communications</h2>

<p>Valley Kidney Center respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This includes any mobile phone numbers or SMS consent you provide to us.</p>

<p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> All the above categories exclude text messaging originator opt‑in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.</p>

<p>Mobile numbers provided for SMS communication will only be used for patient‑care notifications, appointment reminders, and direct communications related to Valley Kidney Center services.</p>

<p>By providing your mobile number, you consent to receive SMS messages from Valley Kidney Center. Message and data rates may apply. You may opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>.</p>
